[E0436] Error: `name` is used after `given`, which it borrows, was changed
    ╭─[ err/369_options_outlive_their_arguments/main.wip:10:9 ]
    │
  8 │     val name = first(&given)
    │         ──┬─  
    │           ╰─── `name` borrows `given`
  9 │     given[1] = "b.txt"
    │     ────┬───  
    │         ╰───── `given` assigned here
 10 │     assert(name.len() == 5)
    │            ──┬─  
    │              ╰─── used here
    │ 
    │ Help: use `name` before `given` changes, or keep a copy that owns its bytes with `String::of(…)`
    │ 
    │ Note: a `str` points into the bytes of what it borrows, so those must not change while the `str` is still used
────╯
